    {
      "id": "u_c7e37d3a5528d651ce3be2b1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To apply this style, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button in __TRILIUM_PH_1__ group from the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Formatting toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_3__. On the floating toolbar, the buttons appear when selecting a text.",
