      "context": "Developer-specific formatting > Keyboard shortcuts",
      "contextHash": "b2aafb8ab925e9dfc6a7085aae3c7c4a7a216314146ef09a2a1e2091329b6f67",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f5e50e90875c169ca7547316_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Alternatively, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Alt__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__K__TRILIUM_PH_5__ combination to apply keyboard shortcut formatting to the current text selection.",
      "sourceHash": "f5e50e90875c169ca7547316bf9ac6511732e52f1b3e78b7063c43d7a716dace",
      "context": "Developer-specific formatting > Keyboard shortcuts",
      "contextHash": "b2aafb8ab925e9dfc6a7085aae3c7c4a7a216314146ef09a2a1e2091329b6f67",
