    {
      "id": "u_e919ac52195e946d1a23e412_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The formatting can be removed by pressing again the button (from the UI or from the keyboard), or by using the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Remove formatting__TRILIUM_PH_2__ button.",
